vFM Player - MIDI drum banks

SD folder: /vFM/midi/banks/DRUM

Copy the supplied BNK and BNK.GZ drum sets. The DRUM section of midi.ini selects the set for each emulated chip/profile.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/midi/banks/DRUM

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
